    "title": "Ohio State loses 4-star homegrown recruit in shocking flip to Bill Belichick's UNC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "The Ohio State Buckeyes football program isn't used to a flip like this one. A flip from OSU to North Carolina? No way, right? Well, now that Bill Belichick is in Chapel Hill, it can happen. It did on Wednesday. Four-star safety recruit Jakob Weatherspoon is now longer coming to Columbus. He plans to be a Tar Heel. Making matters worse is that Weatherspoon is from Avon, Ohio. That's east of Cleveland, only a couple hours from Columbus even if you drive slow. But the allure of Belichick's program must've just been too much, and so the Buckeyes lost a home-state recruit.",
